installing the roles

=======================


i) Create a directory 'roles' under /home/student/ansible
ii) Create a playbook called requirements.yml under the roles directory and download the
given roles under the 'roles' directory using galaxy command under it.

iii) Role name should be 'balancer' and download using this url https://github.com/zee-tek/zee-tek-ansible-role-zee_balancer/archive/main.tar.gz

iv) Role name 'phpinfo' and download using this url https://github.com/zee-tek/ansible-role-zee_php/archive/main.tar.gz.
